# Graceful Takedown: "up to one other target creature" may be left out: Bot1 chooses its two enchanted Memnites (power 2 each) and no
# other creature, so the Wall of Mist is dealt exactly 2 + 2 = 4 (CR 120.3), not the 5 it would be with Memnite #3's power too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Memnite
Memnite
Memnite
Escape Velocity
Graceful Takedown
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Wall of Mist
Escape Velocity
Island x2
Island x12

